Download the latest release from GitHub Releases.
Extract the ZIP file to a folder (e.g., C:\AIAgentMonitorService).
Open Command Prompt as Administrator and run:
cmd


sc create 
AIAgentMonitorService binPath= "C:\AIAgentMonitorService\AIAgentMonitorService.exe" start= a
uto

start the server
sc start AIAgentMonitorService

uninstall the server

stop the server

sc stop AIAgentMonitorService

delete the server
sc delete AIAgentMonitorService

optional
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/AIAgentMonitorService.git
cd AIAgentMonitorService
